+  // validator refuses the moment a follower actually speaks. The SAME real
+  // gap `person-room.mjs` found and fixed on its own fixture state, restated
+  // here rather than edited into the shared fixture file (ws-common's
+  // append-only law for a file nine siblings also touch this wave).
